        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Press TV, Centre for Social Cohesion, Henry Jackson Society, The Spectator\n- People: Nick Cohen, Douglas Murray\n- Topics: media criticism, propaganda, controversies\n\nFacts:\n- Press TV has been the subject of several controversies.\n- Douglas Murray was born on 16 July 1979.\n- Douglas Murray is a British author, journalist, and political commentator.\n- Nick Cohen said that Press TV is \"a platform for the full fascist conspiracy theory of supernatural Jewish power\".\n- Douglas Murray described Press TV as the Iranian government’s propaganda channel.\n- Douglas Murray founded the Centre for Social Cohesion.\n- Douglas Murray is the associate director of the Henry Jackson Society.\n- Douglas Murray is the associate editor of The Spectator.",
